{"total_count":40,"check_runs":[{"id":117176228920,"name":"CodSpeed Performance Analysis","node_id":"CR_kwDOSaSRXM8AAAAbSD9cOA","head_sha":"2ee8eabb7dbe2c4cd87f1cdc54b4cd4410584555","external_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/check-runs/117176228920","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/runs/117176228920","details_url":"https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=details","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","started_at":"2026-10-16T20:17:21Z","completed_at":"2026-10-16T20:17:21Z","output":{"title":"Performance Gate Passed","summary":"\n<details>\n<summary>:warning: <b>40 benchmarks spent significant time in system calls</b></summary>\n\n> System calls cannot be consistently instrumented, so they are not included in the measure, which understates the real cost. Please switch to [the Walltime instrument](https://codspeed.io/docs/instruments/walltime?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=significant_sys_time) to accurately measure system calls.\n>\n> [Measurement and system calls](https://codspeed.io/docs/instruments/cpu?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=significant_sys_time#system-calls)\n>\n> - [`` edges ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_language_frontends%3A%3Alanguage_frontends%3A%3Aedges&runnerMode=Simulation&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark)\n> - [`` extract ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_language_frontends%3A%3Alanguage_frontends%3A%3Aextract&runnerMode=Simulation&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark)\n> - [`` symbols/two_files ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jona