and *customizable* **commit statuses** will improve your team's workflow and code coverage incrementally.\r\n\r\n**File backed configuration** all through the `codecov.yml`. \r\n\r\n## FAQ\r\n- Do you **merge multiple uploads** to the same commit? **Yes**\r\n- Do you **support multiple languages** in the same project? **Yes**\r\n- Can you **group coverage reports** by project and/or test type? **Yes**\r\n- How does **pricing** work? Only paid users can view reports and post statuses/comments. ","external_url":"https://codecov.io","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/codecov","created_at":"2016-09-25T14:18:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T19:12:59Z","permissions":{"administration":"read","checks":"write","contents":"read","emails":"read","issues":"read","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["delete","fork","member","membership","organization","public","pull_request","push","release","repository","status","team_add"]},"pull_requests":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/2086","id":4891655287,"number":2086,"head":{"ref":"fix/2076-parameter-annotation-cache","sha":"2ee8eabb7dbe2c4cd87f1cdc54b4cd4410584555","repo":{"id":1235521884,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes","name":"no-mistakes"}},"base":{"ref":"main","sha":"e0b38220cd2886522dc623e193dbc6fcf33c20fe","repo":{"id":1235521884,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes","name":"no-mistakes"}}}]},{"id":117171091271,"name":"Build benchmarks","node_id":"CR_kwDOSaSRXM8AAAAbR_D3Rw","head_sha":"2ee8eabb7dbe2c4cd87f1cdc54b4cd4410584555","external_id":"26496e91-3a41-5dfb-8715-fad008ca9f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/check-runs/117171091271","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38959592766/job/117171091271","details_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38959592766/job/117171091271","status":"completed","conclusion":"succ